  "description": "An overwhelming talent can dominate its owner's life. U-Hyuk possessed a powerful physique and violent tendencies, yet lived suppressing them. When U-Hyuk happened to visit Club Peach, he caught the eye of Yu-Bin, the club's manager. Recognizing U-Hyuk's talent, Yu-Bin offered him a chance to follow her. Captivated by Yu-Bin, U-Hyuk accepted. U-Hyuk stepped into the underworld. What awaited him, glory or ruin?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
